<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-10-29T10:16:28.272Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 10:16:28 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gold smuggling is now reported to flow through Uganda to finance an Islamic State-linked insurgency operating in eastern DRC, supporting rebel groups. A nurse treating Ebola patients in the DRC was killed by a mob, and a health worker was wounded while responding to a case. The United States imposed sanctions on Rwanda's defence ministry for backing M23 rebels and facilitating the gold smuggling network. The conflict caused 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE9EaHZTX29uTy12a2ZMYmxqQk1NMmpLY0lDQW5uTm9ReFVlQ1I0bTVjUnkzdmhfejBZWkhQMFk5aFZHTTVQcHMzVTh3Vkh6UExRcDZpYUJ6eTBySTVxd0E?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxNRDZzOUVtM2NMaExvWjV0aVNjam51ZmVVVmEyM1RmVm1ROTFoSFUzQk91OGJqUW90QzIyT3V6SUx2V0RXZXotOURZc05rNDc0RFJHcFJyNkcyU2lhMkwtRU1fd0c5ZFRuUEg3WExRaFo5REthcFFac01namE3MVhpMWRSVEY2Mjh1RGsyUVJyR3FGc3U0TUF3OXp1ZXA0ejdvUmp5TUJjZFFTb05fLUxtZWo2SzBEUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxNMnhvbmdWV1pFaFhQNzVCM0JidlBvYTVSd2ppOENPdjVxT2tYcFA2c1ZjR2FIQ0I5VGtVUmo1SHBXWGJtRFhSXzdWd0Q0bjFLU0ZhdUxzb0pGSWRINFZYWUxmWFhERV9GMHA5SXN5WDQ5WVhPTHVVNmVfU2U3RDJJTC1WYVBFRGx3ZHVHMW41SnpsR0hkVGhUYkF0UGdfV0JsSVFBYUpsMDR5ZnNRV29Lb0h6bEthakZXSHpULURjZk1VNllvRWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxOZ09fX1dBT200aVBYSWJ0ZDBndWQyWlA2RkVuclhtMEs0dlpFemtoTGpmWVFxREh2MXZWT29fSnhyUks5TXlyaXhEdW9jVjhlS2tWYkZ1Z2QyQS1aaU9FaEFLakoxQ3RCMzltb2xldkJ4UzNDRWRKM21VWXgtSXp2UlhDbkM1Vkx1emhmajZScWVHUkVmM0tMejZnTUhqV3NNY1BqS0hKem9tUDFyeU1lMGJ0VWY?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTFBxcXNoME5TT0NhVzNZQm